          "summary": "In sshd in OpenSSH before 10.0, the DisableForwarding directive does not adhere to the documentation stating that it disables X11 and agent forwarding.",
          "references": [
            "https://ftp.openbsd.org/pub/OpenBSD/patches/7.6/common/013_ssh.patch.sig",
